    "headline": "AppLovin (NASDAQ:APP) Misses Q2 CY2026 Revenue Estimates, Stock Drops 21%",
    "summary": "Mobile app technology company AppLovin (NASDAQ:APP) fell short of the market’s revenue expectations in Q2 CY2026, but sales rose 52.8% year on year to $1.92 billion. Next quarter’s revenue guidance of $2.07 billion underwhelmed, coming in 0.6% below analysts’ estimates. Its GAAP profit of $3.76 per share was in line with analysts’ consensus estimates.",
